;;;287     * @retval I2C_ARB_LOST             Master or slave transmitter has lost arbitration.
;;;288     * @retval I2C_ABRT_MASTER_DIS      Master operation initiated with the master mode disabled.
;;;289     * @retval I2C_ABRT_TXDATA_NOACK    Transmitted data byte was not acknowledged by the slave.
;;;290     * @retval I2C_ABRT_10ADDR2_NOACK   Second byte of the 10-bit address was not acknowledged by any slave.
;;;291     * @retval I2C_ABRT_10ADDR1_NOACK   First byte of the 10-bit address was not acknowledged by any slave.
;;;292     * @retval I2C_ABRT_7B_ADDR_NOACK   7-bit address was not acknowledged by any slave.
;;;293     * @retval I2C_ERR_TIMEOUT          I2C transfer timeout error.
