;;;1143   /*
;;;1144    * The mode fixes the descriptor topology, so it is settled by the first Start()
;;;1145    * and immutable afterwards: switching between burst capture and streaming
;;;1146    * mid-session has no real use case, and allowing it would mean rebuilding
