;;;1506   /*
;;;1507    * The register table requires configuration to be written with ENABLE = 0, so
;;;1508    * there is no hot path for geometry - the sequence is stop, change, restart. What
;;;1509    * this API buys over "Stop then Init" is that a bad parameter set can never take
;;;1510    * down a capture that is working: validation completes before anything is
;;;1511    * touched (DESIGN.md 12.3).
;;;1512    */
