;;;130    /*
;;;131     * Everything a capture case needs before it can start.
;;;132     *
;;;133     * The geometry cross-check is the reason this is one function rather than a few lines
;;;134     * per case. The demo computes the frame size from the signal row and the driver computes
;;;135     * it from DCI_InitTypeDef; if those disagree, one of the two formulas is wrong and
;;;136     * every later symptom - short frames, overruns, desync - is a consequence. Catching it
;;;137     * here turns a day of guessing into one line of output.
;;;138     */
