;;;418     * every case. Crop dimensions are expressed as a percentage of the row rather than in
;;;419     * absolute pixels: the table spans 160x120 to 800x600, and an absolute window would be
;;;420     * meaningless on one end or out of bounds on the other. Percentages make a single
;;;421     * macro setting valid on every row.
;;;422     */
